OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fan travels 5,000 miles
OL,4,Ato meet hero
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravelling 5,000-mile (8,045km) to
OL,7,Fwatch your team lose may not usually
OL,8,Fleave many football fans with happy
OL,9,Fmemories.
OL,11,FBut for Carl Nixon, the trip from Las
OL,12,FVegas to see Rotherham United beaten
OL,13,F2-1 at Swindon Town was not just about
OL,14,Fthe result.
OL,16,FAfter binge-watching the Welcome to
OL,17,FWrexham documentary he says he
OL,18,Fdeveloped an affinity with the Welsh
OL,19,Fside's ex-striker Paul Mullin, who like
OL,20,FNixon, has a child with autism.
