OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fan travels 5,000 miles
OL,4,Ato meet hero
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd, following Mullin's move from north
OL,7,FWales to South Yorkshire Nixon took the
OL,8,Fplunge on a #2,000 trip to watch his
OL,9,Ffirst football match and meet his
OL,10,Ffootballing hero.
